{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"sp00000000000001","type":"group","x":-80,"y":-480,"width":1880,"height":1300,"color":"4","label":"Smart Plant System"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000002","type":"text","text":"# ESP32 Dev Module\n\nBộ điều khiển trung tâm\n- WiFi: NTP time sync\n- GPIO cho sensors\n- LVGL + TFT_eSPI\n- EEZ Studio UI","x":-20,"y":-280,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000005","type":"text","text":"## Rain Sensor\nGPIO 34 (ADC)\n\nCảm biến mưa\n0-100%","x":500,"y":280,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000004","type":"text","text":"## Soil Moisture\nGPIO 35 (ADC)\n\nĐộ ẩm đất\nDry=4095, Wet=1200","x":500,"y":20,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000003","type":"text","text":"## DHT11\nGPIO 27\n\nNhiệt độ + Độ ẩm","x":500,"y":-240,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000008","type":"text","text":"## Relay Module\n\n- Light: GPIO 15\n- Pump: GPIO 2\n\nActive-low relay\nĐiều khiển đèn + bơm","x":-20,"y":100,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000009","type":"text","text":"## WiFi\n\n- SSID: configured in secrets.h\n- NTP: pool.ntp.org\n- GMT+7 Vietnam","x":-20,"y":410,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000010","type":"text","text":"## UI Variables\n\nhour | minute | date | month | dayof_week | temp | humidity | soil | rain_percent","x":780,"y":520,"width":700,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000012","type":"text","text":"## Switch Touch Area\n\nMở rộng vùng chạm:\n- ext_click_area: 30px mỗi bên\n- Light: (246,146) 50x25 → vùng 231-311, 131-186\n- Pump: (247,190) 50x25 → vùng 232-312, 175-230\n- Tắt clickable cho tất cả widget khác","x":1380,"y":220,"width":350,"height":270,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000006","type":"text","text":"## ST7789 TFT\n320x240 px\n\n- CS: GPIO 17\n- DC: GPIO 16\n- RST: GPIO 5\n- BL: GPIO 32\n- Rotation: 3","x":860,"y":-480,"width":320,"height":290,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000011","type":"text","text":"## Temperature Arc\n\nArc hiển thị nhiệt độ:\n- Range: 0-100\n- Mapping: 0°C → 0, 50°C → 100\n- Background: 180° → 0° (nửa vòng trên)\n- Color: #26d100 (xanh lá)","x":860,"y":-160,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sp00000000000007","type":"text","text":"## XPT2046 Touch\n\n- MOSI: GPIO 23\n- SCLK: GPIO 18\n- MISO: GPIO 19\n- CS: GPIO 21\n- T_IRQ: GPIO 33\n- Rotation: 3\n- Z_THRESHOLD: 20\n- Smoothing filter enabled","x":1395,"y":-240,"width":320,"height":280,"color":"6"}
	],
